{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Backrooms: Final Exam Part II</strong></i> is a cooperative horror game for 1\u20134 players. Together or alone, you'll return to a place you were never meant to leave. The deeper you go, the more uncertain it becomes whether there was ever a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Even more complicated!</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scary atmosphere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 to 4 player co-op </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Proximity voice chat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive AI </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game Difficulties </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stealth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large &amp; difficult map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Primitive but challenging gameplay </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn\u2019t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built using the <strong>SNK V2 system</strong> \u2014 featuring an improved main menu, enhanced lobby, online server browser, difficulty selection, player sound system (with UI feedback and AI reaction), and a dynamic visibility system based on movement, posture, and flashlight use.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801330?t=1750924434","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801330/834efa1f7fea604f02f3dc2a11b1c4ec04c339c8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750924434","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801330/f76f588adacad6590